	new codecs or new features for the codecs it covers.
	The codecs it covers can also be configured using
fnref	sm_vmprx_config_codec_alaw,
fnref	sm_vmprx_config_codec_comfort_noise,
fnref	sm_vmprx_config_codec_g729ab,
fnref	sm_vmprx_config_codec_mulaw,
